# No Emoji

Do not use any emoji characters in this project — including source code, docs, HTML/CSS/JS, i18n strings, commit messages drafted for this repo, comments, CLI output, and UI copy.

Prefer plain text, typographic symbols that are not emoji (when already established), or CSS/SVG for status and decoration.
